  "description": "SLO dashboard for LLMKube inference workloads. Surfaces error-budget burn rates and availability over the configured SLO window. Pyrra bakes the window into the recording-rule name suffix (e.g. 28d -> 4w, 7d -> 7d, 14d -> 2w, 90d -> 12w); use the Window suffix variable below to select the correct suffix for your spec.slo.window value. Default is 4w (28d).",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
